"{path} looks like a LoRA adapter (from `mb train --model-type "
"image_generation_lora`), not a full model checkpoint — `mb export bundle` "
"doesn't apply to it. It's already a portable safetensors artifact, usable "
"directly (e.g. a diffusers pipeline's load_lora_weights())."
msgstr ""
"{path} parece un adaptador LoRA (de `mb train --model-type "
"image_generation_lora`), no un punto de control completo del modelo — `mb "
"export bundle` no se le aplica. Ya es un artefacto safetensors portable y se"
" puede usar directamente (p. ej., load_lora_weights() de una canalización de"
" diffusers)."

